<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JUNE C/A GAP $354 MLN, TRADE GAP $338 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JUNE C/A GAP $354 MLN, TRADE GAP $338 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's preliminary June</p>
<p>current account deficit was $354 million and the trade deficit</p>
<p>was $338 million, the National Bank of Hungary said on Friday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY CURRENT ACCOUNT (in million dollars)</p>
<p>		  June 97  May 97   Jan-June 97 June 96 Jan-June 96</p>
<p> Trade balance  -338	-53	-997	-259     -1,194</p>
<p>  - Exports    1,557    1,550     9,376     1,149	6,767</p>
<p>  - Imports    1,895    1,603    10,372     1,409	7,961</p>
<p>Services and</p>
<p>    incgme	 -92	103	-153	 -29	 -254</p>
<p>  - Tourism	133	137	 551	  97	  406</p>
<p>- Capital'</p>
<p>    investment  -197	-38	-645	-163	 -816</p>
<p>- Other current</p>
<p>    payments     -27	  4	 -59	  37	  156</p>
<p>Unrequited</p>
<p>    transfers     75	 91	 350	  92	  513</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Current account -354	142	-800	-196	 -934</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Foreign direct capital</p>
<p>investments</p>
<p>  - in Hungary    31	495     1,082	  78	  723</p>
<p>NOTE - June 1997 figures are preliminary. Central bank trade figures are based on cash flow data, while Ministry of Industry, Trade and Tourism trade figures are based on customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
